{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>亞太經合組織(APEC)財長會議下周二至周三在香港舉行，消防處指嚴陣以待，確保會議順利舉行。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.FSD-1900_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026IzguxdZQxh1792247379.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p><strong>巡查會議處所及工地　打擊非法加油站</strong></p><p></p><p>消防處指，已全方位執行各項特別安全部署，包括巡查灣仔會展等會議處所、港鐵站、建築工地等。亦到五金舖、化工原料店巡查，以及打擊非法加油站，以防有火警或意外發生，為會議營造安寧有序的良好環境。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T19:58:46.105818+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T14:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T01:17:41.938214+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T19:57:47.554114+00:00","content_hash":"ef7db1bbf67bdada2af17d9d1d40b84681876c099f9f8f058a212349d83a296a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}